<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.99, down 3.19.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 296 to 242.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,979,190, compared with 24,329,225 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
